          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምእመናን ፡ ዋጋቸውን ፡ የምትሰጥበት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጊዜ ፡ ደርሷልና ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወለእለ ፡ ይፈርሁ ፡ ስመከ ፡ ለንኡሶሙ ፡ ወለዐቢ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዮሙ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስምህን ፡ ለሚፈሩ ፡ በስምህ ፡ ለሚያምኑ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 33,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዋጋቸውን ፡ ለታላቁም ፡ ለታናሹም ፡ ትሰ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 34,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጣቸው፡ዘንድ፡ (የዕድሜ፡ የመዓርግ፡ነው)።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወከመ ፡ ትኰንኖሙ ፡ ለእለ ፡ ያማስንዋ ፡ ለምድር ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምድር፡ ሰውነታቸውን፡ በኃጢአት፡የሚያ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሳድፉትን፡ በሚያሳድፉ፡ ትፈርድባቸው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዘንድ፡ የምትፈርድባቸው፡ ጊዜ፡ደርሷልና፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ም ፡ ፲፭ ፥ ፩ ። መዝ ፡ ፪፥ ፩ና ፡ ፭ ፥ ፲፪ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": "፲፱",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፲፱ ፤ ወእምዝ ፡ ተርኅወ ፡ መቅደሱ ፡ ለእግዚአብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሔር ፡ ዘውስተ ፡ ሰማይ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዚህ ፡ በኋላ ፡ በሰማይ፡ ያለ ፡ የእግዚአብ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሔር ፡ መቅደስ ፡ ተከፈተ ፡ አለ ፡ መንግ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሥተ ፡ ሰማይ ፡ ተሰጠች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአስተርአየት ፡ ታቦተ ፡ ሕጉ ፡ ለእግዚአብሔር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንተ ፡ ውስተ ፡ መቅደሱ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሕጉን ፡ ጠብቃ ፡ የምትኖር ፡ ምእመን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "chapter_title",
          "text": "ምዕራፍ ፡ ፲፪ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": "፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፩ ፤ ወአስተርአየ፡ ተአምር፡ ዐቢይ፡በውስተ፡ሰማይ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሰማይ ፡ ደገኛ ፡ ምልክት ፡ ታየ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ብእሲት ፡ እንተ ፡ ትለብስ ፡ ፀሐየ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፀሐይን ፡ ተጐናጽፋ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወወርኅ ፡ ፡ ታሕተ ፡ እገሪሃ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጨረቃን ፡ ተጫምታ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወዲበ ፡ ርእሳኒ ፡ አክሊል ፡ ዘዐሠርቱ ፡ ወክልኤቱ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዋክብት ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አሥራ ፡ ሁለት ፡ ከዋክብት ፡ እንደ ፡ ዕን",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቍ ፡ ፈርፅ ፡ ያለበት ፡ ዘውድ ፡ በራሷ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ላይ ፡ ደፍታ ፡ ታየች ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": "፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፪ ፤ ወፅንስት ፡ ይእቲ ፡ ብእሲት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፀንሳለች ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወትግዕር ፡ ወተሐምም ፡ ለወሊድ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ምጥ ፡ ተይዛ ፡ ለመውለድ ፡ ትጮሃለች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሚካ ፡ ፬ ፥ ፲ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": "፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፫ ፤ ወአስተርአየ፡ ካልእ፡ተአምር፡ በውስተ፡ ሰማይ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዳግመኛም፡ በሰማይ፡ ሌላ፡ ምልክት፡ታየ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 4,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መንግሥተ ፡ ሰማይን ፡ ወርሳ ፡ ክብራ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ታየች ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወመጽአ ፡ መብረቅ ፡ ወቃለ ፡ ነጐድጓድ ፡ ወድልቅ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልቅ ፡ ወበረድ ፡ ዐቢይ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መብረቅ ፡ ነጐድጓድ፡ ድልቅልቅ፡ በረድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሆነ ፡ አለ ፡ መቅሠፍተ ፡ ኃጥአን ፡ ታዘዘ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኅልፈተ ፡ ዓለም ፡ ሆነ ። አንድም፡ (ወእም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዝ) ፡ ቃል ፡ ሥግው ፡ ጎኑን ፡ ተወጋ፡ (ወአ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስተርአየት) ፡ ሕጉን ፡ የምትጠብቅ ፡ ምእ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "መን ፡ ከጎኑ ፡ በፈሰሰ ፡ ውኃ ፡ ተጠምቃ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከመንፈስ ፡ ቅዱስ ፡ ተወልዳ ፡ ከብራ ፡ ታ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የች ፡ (ወመጽአ) ፡ ስብከተ ፡ ሐዋርያት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ትምህርት ፡ ተአምራት ፡ ተደረገ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪አርዌ ፡ ዐቢይ ፡ ወቀይሕ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እሳት ፡ የሚመስል ፡ ታላቅ ፡ ዘንዶ ፡ ታየ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ዘሰብዐቱ ፡ አርእስቲሁ ፡ ወዐሠርቱ ፡ አቅርንቲሁ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሰባት ፡ አርእስት፡ዐሥር፡ ቀንዶች፡ያሉት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በስድስቱ ፡ አንድ ፡ አንድ ፡ በሰባተኛው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "አራት ፡ በቅሎ ፡ ያያል ። አንድም ፡ ስድ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ስቱ ፡ ሁሉ ፡ ጎዳ ፡ ሆነው ፡ በሰባተኛው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዐሥር ፡ በቅሎ ፡ ያየዋል ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወውስተ ፡ አርእስቲሁ ፡ ሰብዐቱ ፡ ቀጸላ ።⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በሰባቱ ፡ አርእስት፡ ላይ ፡ ሰባት ፡ ትርፍ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ያለበት ፡ ቍ ፡ ፱ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": "፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪፬ ፤ ወበዘነቡ ፡ ይስሕብ ፡ ሣልስተ ፡ እዴሆሙ ፡ ለከ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
